     1	"""Rule 19: Third-party and workspace-member imports must be declared in pyproject.toml.
     2	
     3	Why: Rule 4 checks only the DAG of inter-lib imports in production src/, but does
     4	not verify that imported modules are actually declared as dependencies in the
     5	importing package's pyproject.toml. During Slice 4, this imports-not-declared gap
     6	was encountered four times:
