    10	4. sign imported in libs/migrate/tests without being in migrate's dev group
    11	
    12	This rule enforces the invariant:
    13	- For every lib under libs/ and apps/loops, every top-level module imported at runtime
    14	  in src/ (excluding stdlib and the package's own root) must appear in that package's
    15	  declared dependencies (pyproject.toml `[project].dependencies`).
    16	- For every package that declares a `dev` dependency group, every top-level module
    17	  imported at runtime in tests/ (excluding stdlib, own root, and test framework builtins)
    18	  must appear in `dependencies` or `[dependency-groups].dev`.
